ally converts UID strings (`uid://...`) to their mapped resource paths\r\n2. Maintains compatibility with traditional path strings\r\n\r\nThe error handling was improved to only set `extends_path` for valid string literals, rejecting non-string types with appropriate error messages. This maintains type safety while expanding functionality. But I'm not sure about that...\r\n\r\nWhile this PR fixes the issue by enabling UID support for script inheritance paths, I'm not entirely confident in my implementation approach. Given my past experience where I accidentally broke the engine's script debugging mode... I'd appreciate if maintainers could pay extra attention during review.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-24T05:14:26Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T07:01:31Z","closed_at":"2026-02-25T05:07:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f45a6f2a07459e1cf8d333e365ce94197089a784","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"4d49:extend-script-uid","ref":"extend-script-uid","repo":{"id":528673903,"node_id":"R_kgDOH4Lsbw","name":"godot","full_name":"4d49/godot","owner":{"login":"4d49","id":8208165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDgxNjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8208165?v=4","gravatar_id":